{
  "title": "Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Resounding_Rise?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\" style=\"font-size:small\">Requirements + languages + dialogue</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Exploration</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers\">Shadow of the Towers</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorncrown_Rises\" title=\"Thorncrown Rises\">Thorncrown Rises</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Exiles in Thessaleo Fells are seeking help...<br />Wait, there are exiles in Rinascita as well?<br /><br /><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Hidden rewards can be found in this area.</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Command_Rise\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers: Command Rise\">Shadow of the Towers: Command Rise</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"concurrent\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Concurrent Quest</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Twilight_Rise\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers: Twilight Rise\">Shadow of the Towers: Twilight Rise</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 300</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 30</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Energy_Core\" title=\"Advanced Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Advanced Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153038\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 20,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Itzel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXR6ZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Itzel</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration_Quest\" title=\"Exploration Quest\">Exploration Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Thessaleo_Fells\" title=\"Thessaleo Fells\">Thessaleo Fells</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Locate the source of the sound</li>\n<li>Enter the Resounding Rise with Itzel</li>\n<li>Explore the Resounding Rise</li>\n<li>Enter the painting</li>\n<li>Pursue the Abyssal Mercator</li>\n<li>Enter the painting</li>\n<li>Pursue the Abyssal Mercator</li>\n<li>Correctly arrange the paintings</li>\n<li>Enter the painting</li>\n<li>Defeat the Abyssal Mercator</li>\n<li>Talk to Itzel</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Exiles in Thessaleo Fells are seeking help...<br />Wait, there are exiles in Rinascita as well?<br /><br /><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Hidden rewards can be found in this area.</b></span></div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dd><b>???:</b> You brat!</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Oh, where did you run off to?!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Itzel)</dt>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Liel? You're not Liel!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Who's Liel?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Looking for Liel?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I'm Itzel, Liel's older sister.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You've seen him? Skinny lad, loves sticking his nose where it doesn't belong.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Said he saw a tower we could move into for better protection. Went to scout it and hasn't come back since.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Move into the tower?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You're the local Exiles?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Heck no. We're from a sunny little island far away.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> We do a little bit of ship raiding during the trade season. And we fish when the pickings are slim.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Our fearless leader spied a grand merchant fleet off in the distance.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> But our tiny ship was never meant for the deep water and couldn't catch up.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Then a storm hit and wrecked our ship. Next thing I knew, I woke up here, on this beach.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> So you're not from around here...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Yeah... Speaking of here, where are we?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> This is <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Rinascita... I've heard of this place.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You know I love to fish. I could catch enough to feed a whole crew.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> But I hear there are Echoes in Rinascita that could haul in a bigger catch than I ever could.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Ehh... but that's not important. I just want my little brother back.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I think he's in that tower. Went in myself before, but it's a labyrinth inside, and there's monsters everywhere.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I can help.\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> Splendid, welcome aboard friend.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Once we find Liel, you can have the supplies I scavenged. See ya at the tower.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I'll help if you give me some fish.\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> Done. I'll give you five... no ten fish.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Meet ya at the tower!</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> They're... they're <span class=\"new\" title=\"Fanatic Shark (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmFuYXRpY19TaGFyaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Fanatic Sharks</span>?</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> What are Fanatic Sharks?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Our sworn enemies... They washed up onshore with us.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> This loot belongs to the Fanatic Shark!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> The Fanatic Shark tried to attack this place...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> We should keep an eye on their specters. Might be helpful.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Watch for attacks from above!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Enter the painting)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Hah, those fish nuts are better off dead than alive. Now their specters show us the right path.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Fanatic Shark, charge!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> It looks mighty angry.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Friend, help is at hand!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(When TD escapes)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Let it go. We still need to press on, my friend.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> There must be treasure here!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Monsters! Nooo...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Follow me. Over here!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Watch for attacks from above!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> It's that thing again, attacking from a distance. Gutless cur.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Captain, there's a way up!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(When TD escapes)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Argh... It got away again.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Watch out above!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Looks like none of the Fanatic Sharks made it out alive.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> These drawings might tell us something about the tower's past.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> The four bases beneath them seem to have markings. Could they be clues for how to restore them to their rightful positions?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Read the paintings' description)</dt>\n<dd><i>Where to the schools of fish swim? Over the tower, into the silent night sky above...</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Reaching the towers, only shadows of the Fisalia's heir remained as he fulfilled his duty.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>He traveled west into <a href=\"/wiki/Thessaleo_Fells\" title=\"Thessaleo Fells\">Thessaleo Fells</a>, where the three towers of destiny loomed in the distance.</i></dd>\n<dd><i>Beneath these steps, the heir of Fisalia was called to serve the cause.</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Complete the puzzle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You solved the riddle... and you've never been here before?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Together friend!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You'll not escape this time!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Defeat the TD)</dt>\n<dd><b>One of the tower's barriers seems to have weakened.</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Itzel)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Where could that lad have run off to...?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> After I get you back, Liel, you'll be eating fish gut rations.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I told him to stay out of trouble, but he never listened. But oh, he'll start listening after a return voyage of nothing but fish guts!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> That's really harsh...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> A stern lecture ought to be enough.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Speaking of fish, see that gaping hole outside in the sky? Look at all the fish swimming into it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Sends a chill down my spine. Like a maw that spawns unholy monsters.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Ones larger and more terrifying than what we've faced up till now...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> You think monsters will emerge from that hole?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Perhaps those monsters are from inside the tower.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Whatever it is, I'm sure it has something to do with Liel's disappearance.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> And I won't give up before I find him.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What do you plan to do?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Not sure if you've noticed, but I'm a Resonator. For some reason, my Tacet Mark reacted when i got close to that monster.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I'll use my Tacet Mark to track the monster down. With luck, that'll lead me to Liel.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> We didn't find Liel, but nevertheless, I appreciate your help, friend.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Don't mention it.\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> I won't forget you. Till next time!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> A few extra fish and we're even.\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> Of course, here you go. Well, this is where we part. Till next time!</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">高塔的幽影・回声冠塔</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">高塔的幽影・回聲冠塔</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">タワーの幽霊・エコータワー</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">높은</span> <span lang=\"ko\">탑의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">그림자</span> <span lang=\"ko\">・</span> <span lang=\"ko\">반향의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">탑</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;French</b></td><td>Fantôme de la Tour&#160;: Tour vestigiale</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji DE Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3b/Emoji_DE_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221959\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;German</b></td><td>Der Schatten des Turms: Turm des Widerhalls</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ES Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ES Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ES_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Emoji_ES_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221908\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Spanish</b></td><td>Sombra de las torres: Torre Reverberante</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/2.0\" title=\"Version/2.0\">Version 2.0</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Resounding_Rise/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=2.0&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Shadow+of+the+Towers%3A+Resounding+Rise\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div></div>",
